  "summary_en": "Panama's 2026–2036 national AI strategy, built on six pillars (infrastructure, human capital, data/safety/security, governance and ethics, investment and partnerships, sectoral application). It favors agile, innovation-friendly governance via sandboxes, risk-based ethical impact assessments and a National Applied AI Institute, aiming to make Panama Latin America's trusted AI hub.",
